Error [E0134]: `bogus` isn't a unit in scope
  --> tests/ui/unit_literal_unknown_suffix.jet:4:13
    |
  4 |     a :: 500bogus
    |             ^^^^^
 Why: a unit suffix names a member of a `#UnitFamily` you've imported; this suffix isn't one here
 Fix: import the family that defines `bogus`, or write the number without a suffix
